Isn't it great they left you alone?

00:11:11.938 --> 00:11:14.338
Thank you so much!

00:11:17.711 --> 00:11:19.144
Narukami?

00:11:19.413 --> 00:11:20.971
Are you okay?

00:11:25.652 --> 00:11:27.120
Have you calmed down some?

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.055
Yeah... I'm sorry I made you worry.

00:11:30.323 --> 00:11:35.659
I just couldn't turn a blind eye
when I saw them try to steal his money.

00:11:38.098 --> 00:11:41.435
I told myself I just had to protect him.

00:11:41.435 --> 00:11:42.969
Pretty stupid, huh?

00:11:42.969 --> 00:11:45.130
No, I think it's admirable.

00:11:46.306 --> 00:11:49.434
That's the most I could do for him...

00:11:49.743 --> 00:11:57.206
You see, I want to find my self-worth in
something beyond simply being there for Yukiko.

00:11:57.417 --> 00:12:00.687
So I'm always pushing myself,

00:12:00.687 --> 00:12:04.748
telling myself I've got get stronger
and try even harder.

00:12:05.592 --> 00:12:07.794
Satonaka, you're already working hard.

00:12:07.794 --> 00:12:09.396
You think?

00:12:09.396 --> 00:12:11.164
I count on you.

00:12:11.164 --> 00:12:13.029
Really?!

00:12:13.633 --> 00:12:14.930
I'm glad!

00:12:15.035 --> 00:12:17.902
But I don't want you to push yourself.

00:12:18.171 --> 00:12:19.297
Huh?

00:12:20.874 --> 00:12:22.171
It makes me worry.

00:12:23.643 --> 00:12:26.111
Th-thank you...

00:12:33.754 --> 00:12:35.278
I-I got a text!

00:12:36.022 --> 00:12:37.751
It's from Yukiko.

00:12:38.358 --> 00:12:42.260
She said, "Rise's taking everyone out to a club."

00:12:42.929 --> 00:12:44.931
We should go, too.

00:12:44.931 --> 00:12:45.556
Yeah!

00:12:52.639 --> 00:12:55.242
Wow! So this is a club.

00:12:55.242 --> 00:12:57.904
Oh, shoot! I'm getting pumped up.

00:12:59.679 --> 00:13:00.480
Huh?

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:00.881
Geh!

00:13:00.881 --> 00:13:02.075
It's him!

00:13:05.352 --> 00:13:08.855
My, I never expected to run into you here.

00:13:08.855 --> 00:13:12.120
Are you sure high school
students should be here?

00:13:12.359 --> 00:13:13.693
Right back at you.

00:13:13.693 --> 00:13:16.093
What brought you here, anyway?

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:19.966
This is a reputable club,
so I was checking it out.

00:13:19.966 --> 00:13:22.025
It's not as if I was otherwise preoccupied.

00:13:22.302 --> 00:13:24.202
Then let's hang out together.

00:13:25.906 --> 00:13:28.932
Together? You're inviting me?

00:13:29.342 --> 00:13:31.077
Why don't you eat with us?

00:13:31.077 --> 00:13:32.635
If you aren't busy, why not?

00:13:32.879 --> 00:13:35.282
I've been wanting to chat with you.

00:13:35.282 --> 00:13:38.115
I'd like to learn about the detective
the same age as me!

00:13:38.618 --> 00:13:39.786
Let's go!

00:13:39.786 --> 00:13:41.151
Why not?

00:13:41.822 --> 00:13:44.188
Sure. I don't mind...

00:13:44.424 --> 00:13:46.392
Whatcha blushing for?

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.555
I'm not blushing!

00:13:49.362 --> 00:13:51.531
I'll go nab us the VIP room.

00:13:51.531 --> 00:13:53.333
Wow, a VIP room?!

00:13:53.333 --> 00:13:55.801
I know them here. Just give me a sec.

00:14:03.009 --> 00:14:04.110
That's good!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.579
It is really good!

00:14:05.579 --> 00:14:07.480
Yukiko, how many have you had?

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:11.917
Is it wise to be here? Isn't it expensive?

00:14:12.018 --> 00:14:13.451
It's totally cool!

00:14:13.653 --> 00:14:19.059
When I held a secret concert here,
the power went out and we had to cancel it.

00:14:19.059 --> 00:14:21.323
So this is on the house today!

00:14:21.394 --> 00:14:23.263
Woot! You serious?

00:14:23.263 --> 00:14:24.598
Then I won't hold back!

00:14:24.598 --> 00:14:29.228
Yay! We won't hold back either! Right, Kanji?

00:14:31.404 --> 00:14:34.040
Kanji, drink up and start singing!

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.371
Shut up! Leave me alone!

00:14:35.575 --> 00:14:38.009
Kanji, you're so mean!

00:14:38.712 --> 00:14:41.748
Kanji... Kanji. Kanji?

00:14:41.748 --> 00:14:44.182
Great Kanjecture! Just kidding!

00:14:45.085 --> 00:14:46.347
Great Kanjecture?

00:14:48.488 --> 00:14:48.822
Great Kanjecture!

00:14:48.822 --> 00:14:49.990
There's good and bad Kanjectures.
Great Kanjecture!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.458
There's good and bad Kanjectures.
Yukiko's a tad less poised than usual...

00:14:51.458 --> 00:14:53.126
Yukiko's a tad less poised than usual...

00:14:53.126 --> 00:14:54.286
Great Kanjecture!
Yukiko's a tad less poised than usual...

00:14:55.462 --> 00:14:57.987
Oh, shoot! Don't tell me this is...

00:14:58.365 --> 00:15:02.665
I ordered soft drinks. I said nothing alcoholic.

00:15:02.936 --> 00:15:06.337
Oh, no! Is that why I feel hot?

00:15:07.207 --> 00:15:10.267
I told them! I really did!

00:15:12.078 --> 00:15:15.949
Are these seriously alcoholic... drinks?

00:15:15.949 --> 00:15:16.779
Certainly not.

00:15:17.083 --> 00:15:18.812
I'm sure they aren't.

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:25.050
More.

00:15:32.432 --> 00:15:33.956
King's Game!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.462
Kanji!

00:15:35.936 --> 00:15:37.404
Prepare the chopsticks!

00:15:37.404 --> 00:15:38.605
Why should I?

00:15:38.605 --> 00:15:40.874
The King's orders are absolute!

00:15:40.874 --> 00:15:42.609
Get your butt in gear!

00:15:42.609 --> 00:15:43.510
Here you go.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.101
Huh?

00:15:46.313 --> 00:15:48.648
Wh-when'd he get those?

00:15:48.648 --> 00:15:50.775
The King's orders are absolute.

00:15:50.917 --> 00:15:52.612
Yu!

00:15:53.119 --> 00:15:55.110
Is he drunk?

00:15:55.522 --> 00:15:58.958
Tada! Everyone, take your pick!

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:03.124
So, who's the King?

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.765
Mine's red! I'm King!

00:16:05.765 --> 00:16:07.858
Yikes, this can't be good!

00:16:08.535 --> 00:16:12.339
As King I order No.3 to rush over...

00:16:12.339 --> 00:16:14.207
...and give me a smooch!

00:16:14.207 --> 00:16:15.275
Kissy!

00:16:15.275 --> 00:16:16.970
Geh! Not No.3!

00:16:17.344 --> 00:16:18.368
Change that to 2.

00:16:18.611 --> 00:16:20.780
Forget it! No changing numbers, Kingy.

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:22.983
Smooch! Yay, smooch! Yay!

00:16:22.983 --> 00:16:24.712
A-a smooch?
Smooch! Yay, smooch! Yay!

00:16:24.985 --> 00:16:28.682
Kanji, I knew you had your eyes set on me.

00:16:29.022 --> 00:16:33.093
Okay, I'll give you my innocence!

00:16:33.093 --> 00:16:36.256
Whoa, don't! I'll freakin' kill you!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:41.001
Well, there's two out and
we're only in the first round!

00:16:41.001 --> 00:16:42.525
Was it that kind of game?

00:16:42.869 --> 00:16:45.531
Now for Round 2!

00:16:45.972 --> 00:16:48.167
Who's the King?

00:16:58.118 --> 00:16:58.948
I'm King!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:03.184
P-please make a reasonable command.

00:17:03.423 --> 00:17:06.526
He can't! Wha' comes affer smooches?

00:17:06.526 --> 00:17:09.654
Iss gotta be more intimate than a smooch.

00:17:11.331 --> 00:17:13.424
We sh'd ress on his lap!

00:17:13.566 --> 00:17:15.534
Sit on 'is lap!

00:17:15.935 --> 00:17:18.438
Skip straigh' to hugging!

00:17:18.438 --> 00:17:21.965
I know! Piggybacks're all the rage.

00:17:22.175 --> 00:17:23.472
Are they serious?

00:17:23.676 --> 00:17:26.008
Go on, make up y'r mind.

00:17:33.853 --> 00:17:34.785
Number 2!

00:17:45.498 --> 00:17:46.829
I got No. 2...

00:17:47.367 --> 00:17:48.629
Sit on my lap!

00:17:51.371 --> 00:17:52.565
It-it's me.

00:17:53.273 --> 00:17:54.874
The King's order are...

00:17:54.874 --> 00:17:56.569
...absoloo!

00:18:11.291 --> 00:18:13.259
Wow, not bad!

00:18:13.259 --> 00:18:14.692
Me nex'!

00:18:17.363 --> 00:18:21.034
Chie, y'gotta hug him like this!

00:18:21.034 --> 00:18:22.797
Get with it.

00:18:23.837 --> 00:18:28.331
Hey, lowly commoners! That King's mine!

00:18:28.775 --> 00:18:29.764
Move it!

00:18:29.909 --> 00:18:32.343
Yu...

00:18:32.579 --> 00:18:34.979
Yu, don't hog all of them!

00:18:35.515 --> 00:18:37.813
It-it's because I'm the King.

00:18:40.353 --> 00:18:44.724
I'm king nex'! That'd make me queen.

00:18:44.724 --> 00:18:45.992
Draw a chopstick!

00:18:45.992 --> 00:18:51.064
So, this time someone hasta share
a humiliating story about themselves

00:18:51.064 --> 00:18:52.832
that they'd norm'ly never bring up!

00:18:52.832 --> 00:18:55.034
Yer up, Naoto!

00:18:55.034 --> 00:18:56.002
Huh?

00:18:56.002 --> 00:18:57.902
You don't have to if you don't want to, Naoto.

00:18:58.238 --> 00:19:00.399
No, I don't mind.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:05.512
But in exchange, you all have to tell me
about something as well.

00:19:05.512 --> 00:19:07.707
Sure! Bring it on.

00:19:08.348 --> 00:19:13.650
I can't think of any embarrassing stories,
so I'll explain my past.

00:19:14.387 --> 00:19:20.019
The Shirogane family line has been helping
the police as detectives for generations.

00:19:20.426 --> 00:19:22.087
It's the fifth generation with me,

00:19:22.195 --> 00:19:24.697
so I'm living with my predecessor-
my grandfather.

00:19:24.697 --> 00:19:27.928
So you're just like Kindaichi!

00:19:28.201 --> 00:19:31.070
My grandfather has strong
connections with the police,

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:33.698
so he's helping me since
I still have a lot to learn.

00:19:35.642 --> 00:19:38.378
That's it?! No punchline?

00:19:38.378 --> 00:19:41.176
No. Sorry for the letdown.

00:19:42.215 --> 00:19:45.082
Naoto, thass so embarrassing!

00:19:46.986 --> 00:19:48.248
I'm sleepy...

00:19:48.488 --> 00:19:50.149
Fill her up, on the rocks.

00:19:50.423 --> 00:19:52.948
Are you seriously drunk, Senpai?

00:19:53.226 --> 00:19:56.462
Now it is your turn.

00:19:56.462 --> 00:19:58.191
I would like to hear your answer.

00:19:58.698 --> 00:20:02.634
Honestly, how were you
connected to those murders?

00:20:02.936 --> 00:20:07.373
You have such a bad grasp
on the situation here that it's funny.

00:20:07.607 --> 00:20:14.479
Well, we go 'nto the TV t' rescue people
affer they get kidnapped!

00:20:15.848 --> 00:20:20.285
And then w' use Persona on all the Shadows...

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.512
Persona!

00:20:21.821 --> 00:20:23.118
Hey, watch it!

00:20:24.357 --> 00:20:26.188
Are you mocking me?

00:20:26.426 --> 00:20:28.061
But iss true!

00:20:28.061 --> 00:20:29.128
Persona! Persona!

00:20:29.128 --> 00:20:31.931
Oh, jeez! You make quite the pair when drunk.
Persona! Persona!

00:20:31.931 --> 00:20:32.329
Oh, jeez! You make quite the pair when drunk.

00:20:32.565 --> 00:20:35.432
I see you aren't willing to tell me.

00:20:35.702 --> 00:20:38.068
But this doesn't have alcohol in it.

00:20:38.371 --> 00:20:40.707
You're such a tease.

00:20:40.707 --> 00:20:43.076
I confirmed as much when I first arrived.

00:20:43.076 --> 00:20:48.114
They stopped serving alcohol here
in protest to the rash of DUIs last year.

00:20:48.114 --> 00:20:51.709
Huh? Does that mean we're
drunk off the atmosphere?

00:20:51.985 --> 00:20:55.250
Who cares f'we are?

00:20:55.989 --> 00:20:57.752
G'nigh!

00:20:58.024 --> 00:21:02.484
How are we supposed to get back
with three of them out cold? Right, Yu?

00:21:02.795 --> 00:21:05.161
Fill her up, straight.

00:21:05.498 --> 00:21:07.398
Is this a group of imbeciles?

00:21:12.438 --> 00:21:12.639
HAGAKURE

00:21:12.639 --> 00:21:15.408
HAGAKURE
Dang! This is good.

00:21:15.642 --> 00:21:17.944
I came here a lot when
we were shooting dramas.

00:21:17.944 --> 00:21:21.175
They've got the best ramen in town.

00:21:22.382 --> 00:21:25.051
Do you remember what happened last night?

00:21:25.051 --> 00:21:30.890
Oh, supposedly we fell asleep fairly early on,
but it was quite the party!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.881
Right, Yu?

00:21:33.192 --> 00:21:35.626
I took things a little too seriously.

00:21:35.962 --> 00:21:38.931
My head is killing me.

00:21:39.365 --> 00:21:41.196
It's on the house.

00:21:41.834 --> 00:21:43.202
Aika?

00:21:43.202 --> 00:21:45.405
What are you doing working here?

00:21:45.405 --> 00:21:48.441
An acquaintance runs the shop,
so I'm training here.

00:21:48.441 --> 00:21:51.035
Wow! You even train during trips...

00:21:51.277 --> 00:21:53.646
Isn't this Hagakure-don?

00:21:53.646 --> 00:21:55.882
I didn't know it was on the regular menu!

00:21:55.882 --> 00:21:57.816
Eat up before it gets cold.

00:21:58.217 --> 00:22:00.553
I wonder if I can eat it all...

00:22:00.553 --> 00:22:02.851
I'll be a gentlebear and help!

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:05.089
I was still eating that!

00:22:05.491 --> 00:22:07.293
But you were all done.

00:22:07.293 --> 00:22:08.851
Was not!

00:22:10.063 --> 00:22:12.365
It's just about time for us to head back.

00:22:12.365 --> 00:22:15.068
It's that late already?

00:22:15.068 --> 00:22:17.730
Looking back, I had a pretty good time.

00:22:18.104 --> 00:22:20.873
What should we get for Nanako?

00:22:20.873 --> 00:22:22.602
Let's pick it out together!

00:22:22.842 --> 00:22:24.811
Alrighty, let's go!

00:22:24.811 --> 00:22:26.176
Wait!

00:22:26.646 --> 00:22:29.549
I'm so stuffed I can't move...

00:22:29.549 --> 00:22:31.380
Help me!

00:22:32.852 --> 00:22:34.513
Let's leave him.

00:22:35.188 --> 00:22:37.281
The Queen's orders are absolute.

00:22:37.557 --> 00:22:42.119
Farewell, Kuma. I'm leaving you here
along with my memories of youth.

00:22:43.329 --> 00:22:48.858
Wait, help me! I can't cover my ticket back!

00:22:50.370 --> 00:23:03.380
Kimi to aruita tsuugakuro hinabiru keshiki mitsumete

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:13.693
Haru no koutei kasenshiki natsu matsuri-

00:23:13.693 --> 00:23:24.327
Minna de waratte katayose sugoshiteta hibi

00:23:24.704 --> 00:23:31.872
Kono nanike nai nichijou wo nagamete

00:23:33.379 --> 00:23:41.184
Kako kara ima made sugoshite kita yo

00:23:41.421 --> 00:23:49.259
Kyou kara asu ashita kara mirai he

00:23:50.797 --> 00:24:02.102
Minna to kizuita kizuna himete aruki dasu

00:24:05.511 --> 00:24:08.002
Right. Regarding those materials...

00:24:08.214 --> 00:24:11.240
I'll take them. Send them over ASAP.

00:24:18.391 --> 00:24:20.493
Let's split up and gather information on Naoto.

00:24:20.493 --> 00:24:21.391
Senpai!

00:24:21.494 --> 00:24:24.030
I don't think of this as a game.

00:24:24.030 --> 00:24:25.431
You could get killed!

00:24:25.431 --> 00:24:27.333
He's just like a little brat!

00:24:27.333 --> 00:24:31.030
It's time for the body-altering operation!
